The image slicing, resize-size selection, position ids and placeholder layout in
runtime/image_processor.cpp and runtime/prompt.cpp, and the vision tower, merger and
hybrid decoder graphs in vision.py and decoder.py, follow the MiniCPM-OCR and Qwen3.5
implementations in Hugging Face Transformers 5.22.2
(src/transformers/models/minicpm_ocr, src/transformers/models/qwen3_5):
https://github.com/huggingface/transformers/tree/v5.22.2
