The uint8 antialiased bicubic resize in runtime/image_processor.cpp is adapted from
PyTorch v2.15.0, aten/src/ATen/native/cpu/UpSampleKernel.cpp and
aten/src/ATen/native/cpu/UpSampleKernelAVXAntialias.h:
https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/tree/v2.15.0/aten/src/ATen/native/cpu
